<font size="22"><b>Staff Rules</b></font>
<font color="#BBBBBB"><i>You are on a staff team. These apply on top of the general rules.</i></font>

<font size="18" color="#7FB2FF"><b>Conduct</b></font>
<b>1.</b> Stay professional on duty. You represent the facility.
<b>2.</b> Do not abuse your tools, keycards or authority on other players.
<b>3.</b> No favouritism. Treat every inmate the same.

<font size="18" color="#7FB2FF"><b>Use of force</b></font>
<b>4.</b> Give a clear verbal warning before using force, unless someone is attacking.
<b>5.</b> Lethal force only against an <b>immediate threat to life</b> or an armed escaped convict.
<b>6.</b> <font color="#FF6E6E"><b>Never</b></font> shoot a cuffed or detained player.

<font size="18" color="#7FB2FF"><b>Procedure</b></font>
<b>7.</b> Pat down inmates before placing them in a cell or when sentencing them.
<b>8.</b> Only sentence an inmate with a valid roleplay reason.
<b>9.</b> Follow the chain of command. Higher ranks have the final say on duty.

<font color="#BBBBBB">Breaking staff rules can get you job-banned.</font>
